{"ref":"BDB, דֵּעַ²","hw":"דֵּעַ²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דֵּעַ</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>knowledge, opinion</strong> (late)—only sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דֵּעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 32:6\" href=\"/Job.32.6\">Jb 32:6</a> + 3 times, and pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">דֵּעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 37:16\" href=\"/Job.37.16\">37:16</a>; all in speech of Elihu.<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>knowledge</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּמִים ד׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 37:16\" href=\"/Job.37.16\">Jb 37:16</a> <em>one perfect in knowledge</em> (of God).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>judgment, opinion</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 36:3\" href=\"/Job.36.3\">Jb 36:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַוֹּת דֵּעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 32:6\" href=\"/Job.32.6\">32:6</a> <em>to declare my opinion</em>, so v <a data-ref=\"Job 36:10\" href=\"/Job.36.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 36:17\" href=\"/Job.36.17\">17</a>.","next":"BDB, דֵּעָה","prev":"BDB, יָדָע"}